# Alembic Migrations

This directory contains database schema migration scripts.

## Common Commands

```bash
# Apply all migrations to head
alembic upgrade head

# Rollback one revision
alembic downgrade -1

# Create a new empty migration
alembic revision -m "message"

# Auto-generate migration by diffing models vs database
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "message"

# Show current revision
alembic current

# Show migration history
alembic history
```

## Configuration Notes

- `env.py` integrates `backend.models.tables.Base.metadata` for autogenerate
- Database URL comes from `backend.services.db.DATABASE_URL` (no need to edit alembic.ini)
- `render_as_batch=True` is enabled for SQLite ALTER TABLE compatibility
